OPAL

Performance-first Linux remote desktop.

install --> make -j"$(nproc)" && sudo make install
run     --> opal
doctor  --> opal doctor
test    --> make test
server  --> make deploy-rendezvous

dependencies

automatic / OPAL setup
  tailscale        --> installed/configured when WAN tailnet setup is needed (curl required)
  uinput           --> module/rule configured by sudo make install
  systemd user     --> OPAL host/bridge units installed by sudo make install
  firewall rules   --> firewalld/UFW LAN rules added by sudo make install when either tool exists

manual required
  c++20 compiler
  make
  pkg-config
  SDL3 + development files
  OpenSSL + development files
  OpenGL/libglvnd + development files
  FFmpeg executable
  libavformat + development files
  libavcodec + development files
  libavutil + development files
  libswresample + development files
  libpulse + libpulse-simple + development files
  gpu-screen-recorder --> required for native Wayland host capture; preferred on X11
  PipeWire            --> required for native Wayland host capture/audio integration
  xdg-desktop-portal  --> required for native Wayland portal capture
  compositor portal   --> xdg-desktop-portal-kde / -gnome / -wlr or equivalent
  systemd + udev      --> required by the standard Linux install/service path
  curl                --> required only if OPAL needs to install Tailscale

optional / integration
  tailscale        --> WAN direct path; OPAL can still use LAN/rendezvous without it
  firewalld or UFW --> only needed for automatic firewall rule management
  pactl or wpctl   --> used by opal doctor to report the active audio service

Fedora --> sudo dnf install gcc-c++ make pkgconf-pkg-config SDL3-devel openssl-devel libglvnd-devel pulseaudio-libs-devel ffmpeg-free ffmpeg-free-devel pipewire xdg-desktop-portal
Arch   --> sudo pacman -S --needed base-devel pkgconf sdl3 openssl libglvnd libpulse ffmpeg pipewire xdg-desktop-portal
Debian --> sudo apt-get install g++ make pkg-config libsdl3-dev libssl-dev libgl1-mesa-dev libpulse-dev ffmpeg libavformat-dev libavcodec-dev libavutil-dev libswresample-dev pipewire xdg-desktop-portal
